6. Inference

The linear regression model demonstrates high accuracy and low prediction error.
Environmental and solar parameters strongly influence power generation output.
The trained model can be used for solar power forecasting, aiding in better energy management.
Future improvements could involve testing advanced models (e.g., Random Forest, Gradient Boosting) for even better accuracy.


